  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The previous version of youtube-dl did not return any results by default when trying to resolve URLs for age-restricted videos.\nHowever, the newly replaced yt-dlp resolves URLs of age-restricted videos by default, and age-restricted videos can be viewed in VRChat.\nIs this the expected behavior? Please check once.\nIf it is not the expected behavior, we should make yt-dlp a build that can use the option `--age-limit 17`.\n\n[Age-restricted youtube videos for testing](https://youtu.be/AvlOPTzbD40)",
